       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TCOUNTWO.
      *REMARKS. Q10 - SHOWS WORK ORDER COUNTS BY STATUS AND PRIORITY.
      *C--------------------------------------------------------------
      *C 02/25/93  JSB REQ #6306
      *C     ADDED "PR" AS A NEW WO STATUS FOR PRE-RELEASE.
      *C
      *C 09/11/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGE.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINQUIRY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1102
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-ZONE-PRTY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WZPF-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                   PIC X(2000).
       FD  PRINT-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                   PIC X(80).
       FD  WO-BASIC-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WBFREC.
       01  WBFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1002.
       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  LAST-NUM-USED-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PLANNED-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFREC.
       01  WPFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1102.
       FD  WO-ZONE-PRTY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WZPFREC.
       01  WZPFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0501.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
